  {
   "id": "q10",
   "number": "10",
   "type": "mcq_single",
   "stem": "In a row of 30 students, Varun is 19<sup>th</sup> from the left end. What is his position from the right end?",
   "options": [
    {
     "label": "A",
     "text": "10<sup>th</sup>"
    },
    {
     "label": "B",
     "text": "12<sup>th</sup>"
    },
    {
     "label": "C",
     "text": "11<sup>th</sup>"
    },
    {
     "label": "D",
     "text": "13<sup>th</sup>"
    }
   ],
   "answer": "B",
   "solution": "Total number of students in the row = 30\n\nVarun's position from the left end = 19<sup>th</sup>\n\nSo, Varun's position from the right end = 30 – 19 + 1 = 12<sup>th</sup>",
   "topics": [
    "Logical Reasoning"
   ],
