   "type": "mcq_single",
   "stem": "If X is the greatest 5-digit number that can be formed by using the digits 3, 0, 5, 6 and 9 each only once, then the place value of the hundreds place digit of X is \\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_.",
