  {
   "id": "q15",
   "number": "15",
   "type": "mcq_single",
   "stem": "![If + +](asset:q15-stem)",
   "options": [
    {
     "label": "A",
     "text": "₹ 40"
    },
    {
     "label": "B",
     "text": "₹ 250"
    },
    {
     "label": "C",
     "text": "₹ 80"
    },
    {
     "label": "D",
     "text": "₹ 300"
    }
   ],
   "answer": "D",
   "solution": "![We have, + = ₹ 340 ... i Also, + + = ₹ 380 ⇒ + ₹ 340 = ₹ 380 Using i ⇒ = ₹ 380 – ₹ 340 = ₹ 40 Now, ₹ 40 + = ₹ 340 Using i ⇒ = ₹ 340 – ₹ 40 = ₹ 300 16-17 : Events Number of students participated Dance 7 ×10 = 70 Singing 5 ×10 = 50 Swimming 3 ×10 = 30 Race 4 ×10 = 40 Writing 6 ×10 = 60](asset:q15-sol)",
